# Shiroe CODEOWNERS — the single effective ownership file (SHR-020).
#
# GitHub reads exactly one CODEOWNERS per repo and prefers .github/CODEOWNERS
# over a root one. The root file therefore looked authoritative while having
# no effect; its rules were merged here and it was deleted.
#
# Matching is LAST-match-wins, so the catch-all comes first and every
# path-specific rule after it. Reviews are auto-requested when a PR touches
# matching paths.

